{
  "name": "pdf edit redact_area removes a field only when it covers every widget of it: a text field with two widgets keeps its value and its other widget when one is covered, on another page or the same one, and goes with its value once both are, and a radio group keeps its value until the area covers both of its buttons, also when each area of one batch covers one of them",
